    intro: ["This is a free trucking invoice template made for owner-operators, carriers, and freight haulers who bill brokers and shippers per load or per mile. It has room for the trip and BOL numbers, the pickup and delivery points, and the rate, so a broker can match your invoice to the load and pay it fast.","It is completely free, with no signup and no watermark. Download the editable Word and PDF files and fill them in on your own computer, or use the generator below to build a freight invoice in the browser and download a print-ready PDF in minutes."],
    included: ["A load or trip reference, BOL (bill of lading) number, and pickup and delivery locations, so a broker can tie the invoice to the exact shipment","Line items for the freight charge (flat rate or per-mile), fuel surcharge, and accessorials like detention, layover, or lumper fees","A header for your business name, logo, MC/DOT number, and contact details, plus a bill-to section for the broker or shipper","A unique invoice number with issue and due dates so every load is easy to track and follow up on","Automatic subtotal, tax, and grand total, plus a notes and payment-terms area for quick-pay, factoring, or Net 30 terms","Free editable Word and PDF files, print-ready on one page, with no watermark and no signup"],
